flowchart TB
  CLI[CLI / projects] --> LEX[Lexer]
  LEX --> PARSE[Parser and AST]
  PARSE --> SEMA[Resolution and semantics]
  SEMA --> IR[Validated IR]
  IR --> TARGET[Target backend]
  TARGET --> BIN[Assembly / object / executable]
  RUNTIME[Runtime in Moislang] --> TARGET
  ABI[ABI/OS boundary assembly] --> RUNTIME
